  of the listening and reading that i'm  doing aided by the  you know  highlighting of these words and phrases  that i have saved and for me i find that  effective but i that doesn't mean that  there aren't other people who would  benefit from both uh srs and  uh sentence mining so again i've talked  a bit longer than i wanted please keep  sending your questions in  and as i say  once a week every week i will try to  answer at least two of them so thank you  for your attention bye for now  you
 

